text/html;q=0.9, application/json, */*;q=0.1   -> application/json (q=1000)
text/*;q=0.5, text/csv;q=0.8                   -> text/csv (q=800)
image/png, image/*;q=0.5                       -> 406 Not Acceptable
*/*                                            -> application/json (q=1000)
application/xml, text/html;q=0                 -> 406 Not Acceptable
text/*, text/html;q=0                          -> text/csv (q=1000)
